# Defensive: never let a Pokémon sprite cache land in the repo. The real
# cache is at ~/.tokenmon/ (outside this dir), but if anyone ever points
# it inside the project tree we don't want sprites committed alongside
# the code — they're third-party assets fetched at runtime from PokeAPI.
sprites/
sprites_shiny/
item_sprites/
pokedex_descriptions.json
weather_cache.json
